title: Rack3B
---
// Talk target of the drying rack in 3B (Interact layer). See drawers_3b.yarn.
-> Look
    <<if $r1_thu2_socks_at == "rack">>
        You: Blush. Still on the rack. So they were in the wash. Eventually.
        <<set $r1_thu2_socks_noted to true>>
        <<note thu2_socks "The socks?">>
    <<else>>
        You: Two T-shirts and a towel. Drying since Sunday.
    <<endif>>
-> Put the blush socks on <<if $r1_thu2_socks_at == "rack">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks_at to "">>
    <<set $item_blush_socks to false>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks to "on">>
    You: Fine. Blush.
-> Take the blush socks <<if $r1_thu2_socks_at == "rack">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks_at to "">>
    <<set $item_blush_socks to true>>
===
